<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S4.F4.7.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 4</span>: </span><span id="S4.F4.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="S4.F4.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Qualitative Comparisons with the SOTA Open-sourced Methods.</span>
<span id="S4.F4.3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_smallcaps">Inset</span> significantly outperforms open-source baselines in visual consistency and precise attribute binding, avoiding common failure cases such as object misalignment or the inability to render specific actions and textures.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2605.12305v1/x5.png" id="S4.F5.1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" width="789" height="725" alt="Refer to caption">
