<span id="S4.F5.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Qualitative Comparisons with Advanced Close-sourced Methods.</span>
<span id="S4.F5.3.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_smallcaps">Inset</span> demonstrates superior image fidelity and stability when handling complex interleaved instructions, particularly in maintaining identity consistency across challenging visual contexts.
</span></figcaption>
</figure>
